{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revive &amp; Repeat</strong> is an exciting card-based roguelike dungeon crawler where every step tests your fate. Choose your hero, collect powerful artifacts, and battle ruthless creatures in procedurally generated dungeons.\u00a0Every choice changes your destiny \u2014 take risks, win, die, and revive again to go further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with other players on the leaderboard, discover the perfect modifier combinations, and prove that your build is the strongest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692490/extras/29e4dab6370ccf4146fb4fb7d5582aec.poster.avif?t=1767012129\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692490/extras/29e4dab6370ccf4146fb4fb7d5582aec.webm?t=1767012129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692490/extras/29e4dab6370ccf4146fb4fb7d5582aec.mp4?t=1767012129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>TURN-BASED COMBAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your enemies one move at a time. Strategy, luck, and smart choices decide your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692490/extras/0dca828b5cd674b5284b13b31017f7f8.poster.avif?t=1767012129\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692490/extras/0dca828b5cd674b5284b13b31017f7f8.webm?t=1767012129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692490/extras/0dca828b5cd674b5284b13b31017f7f8.mp4?t=1767012129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FIVE UNIQUE HEROES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of the heroes \u2014 each with their own personality, skills, and unique talents. Experience different playstyles and uncover the secret of the fifth hero hidden deep within the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692490/extras/fcc43a4c5af9ea5351586595885fa086.poster.avif?t=1767012129\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692490/extras/fcc43a4c5af9ea5351586595885fa086.webm?t=1767012129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692490/extras/fcc43a4c5af9ea5351586595885fa086.mp4?t=1767012129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SHAPE YOUR HERO YOUR WAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your run by choosing from nine modifiers \u2014 enhance your hero, combine effects, and unlock new ones as you earn points in the dungeon. Every choice brings you closer to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692490/extras/cf7b2b2616a683b1fabc4207480e4621.poster.avif?t=1767012129\" width=600 height=338 ><sour